@startuml
title Supply offer: the supplier and the contractor
[*] --> offered : supplier offers (145)
offered --> offered : supplier revises its price (146)
offered --> withdrawn : supplier withdraws (147)
offered --> accepted : contractor accepts (148)
offered --> declined : contractor declines (149)
offered -[dotted]-> accepted : supplier cannot accept its own offer (150)
withdrawn --> [*]
accepted --> [*]
declined --> [*]
@enduml
